escription": "(Studio: Brian Williams) A surprise visit to Iraq by Secretary of State Colin Powell, who vowed that the US would speed up delivery of reconstruction aid, and a government audit finding examples of fraud & carelessness in handling funds for Iraq noted. \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64290.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761125, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761115, "segment_id": "kRpO25A1Qa", "segment_broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "segment_title": "Making Your Vote Count (Florida's Voting System)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) The outrage of Florida Democrats over the Republican Party\u2019s mailing of brochures urging voters to order absentee ballots in the midst of controversy over the reliability of new, electronic voting machines noted. \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 30, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64320.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761126, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761115, "segment_id": "Hion9Orj3w", "segment_broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "segment_title": "Malibu, California / Beach Brawl", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) Report introduced. \n (Malibu, California: George Lewis) The fight in Malibu, California, over which parts of the beach are public or private featured; details given of the complicated system of easements. [Homeowners\u2019 attorney Marshall GROSSMAN\u2020- states the property owners\u2019 view.] [California Coastal Commission Sara WAN\u2020- says public access is important to the people of this state.] [Beach USERS \u2013 comment.] \n (NOTE: Local weather bulletin on screen.)", "segment_duration": 150, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64350.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761127, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 761115, "segment_id": "60Deir1Bj6", "segment_broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 10, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "64500.0", "legacy_segment_id": 761128, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "2fKgDOgDDP", "broadcast_date": "2004-07-30", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1730, "broadcast_description": null, "legac